# ignore .terraform provider binary caches and lockfiles
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
.terraform.lock.hcl
.env
.env.*
*sa-key*.json
*credentials*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
*.db
